{"repositoryId":1422544363,"availability":"available","full":"adityanathpatel/Tic-Toc-Toe","name":"Tic-Toc-Toe","description":"Modern React 19 Tic-Tac-Toe created by Aditya Nath Patel for Hacktoberfest 2026. Features P2P WebRTC multiplayer, unbeatable Minimax AI, local PvP, web audio effects, and persistent score tracking.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"JavaScript","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-16T18:40:17Z","updated":"2026-10-16T20:44:27Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://tic-tac-toe-by-aadi.netlify.app/","topics":[],"demo":"https://tic-tac-toe-by-aadi.netlify.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T18:04:36.699Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T18:04:36.699Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T18:04:36.699Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-19T18:04:36.699Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["[]( [](LICENSE) []( []( [](CODEOFCONDUCT.md) [](SECURITY.md)","A modern, fast, and responsive Tic-Tac-Toe web game built with React 19 and Vite. Features Online Real-Time Multiplayer (WebRTC P2P) with 6-digit room codes, an unbeatable Minimax AI (with Alpha-Beta pruning), local 2-Player (PvP) mode, synthesized Web Audio API sound effects, and persistent score tracking."],"features":["Play Online (P2P Multiplayer): Generate a unique 6-digit room code, share the code or direct invite link (?room=123456) with a friend, and play in real time with instant WebRTC DataChannel connection and live reaction…","vs Computer: Play against AI with 3 levels (Unbeatable Minimax, Challenging, Casual).","2 Players: Pass-and-play on the same device.","Side Choice: Play as X (goes first) or O (goes second; computer makes the opening move).","Audio Effects: Built-in sound effects generated via native Web Audio API (no external audio files, with mute toggle)."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/adityanathpatel/Tic-Toc-Toe/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"31707548e4d96ebb9f3a4d77318